	<content contentuid="h02b6169fge5dbg41bcgb6d1g100fd33adcd2" version="1">Mystra's Footsteps</content>
	<content contentuid="h830b6361gc763g475bg80a3g27f46986b496" version="1">The leather at the toes is worn pale. Whoever wore these boots rarely walked on the ground.</content>
	<content contentuid="ha7ddec64g8666g4fe7g9408g235c0bcba5a8" version="1">Mystra's Blessing</content>
	<content contentuid="h4f2441d1g5fbfg4f52g9a17gbaa3008a1854" version="1">The wearer can fly, takes no damage from falling, and has &lt;LSTag Tooltip="Resistant"&gt;Resistance&lt;/LSTag&gt; to &lt;b&gt;all damage&lt;/b&gt;.</content>
